THE THREE SHAPES, AND WHO READS EACH:

  UNPACK   gates/gatekit.py:60        read by gates/gate-surface.py:vocabulary()  -- the OWNER
  VERDICTS checks/*, gates/*         read by gates/gate-surface.py:declaration() -- a GATE about itself
  NAME     .agents/slop/hooks/run.py:56   read by NOTHING -- a private copy in a RUNNER

  THE THIRD IS OUTSIDE `HOMES=('checks','gates')`, so `gates-pop.discover()` cannot
  see it, and `declares_surface()` (hooks/run.py:69) filters ON `VERDICTS`, so the
  runner that HOLDS the copy is also the runner that cannot see it.
